        "content": "<p>asteurer opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15000\">PR #15000</a> from <code>asteurer:bindgen-update</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Completes <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13768\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/13768</a>.</p>\n<h3>Summary</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Adds more helpful error message to the <code>component::bindgen</code> macro when a WIT has sync exports and async imports.</li>\n<li>Adds documentation demonstrating the syntax that's used to flag the resource method types.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>",
