    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> alexcrichton created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/15000#discussion_r4384149528\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Ah that might be a bit outdated in that explainer at this point and/or need some more clarification. That was an original aspiration of concurrency but we ended up walking it back to the current system which is semi-colorless sort of but not 100% as you're expecting with that test.</p>\n</blockquote>",
